    "title": "Peacock women's soccer plays two top-five GLVC teams this weekend - NewsBreak",
    "text": "7 hours ago FAYETTE, Iowa - The Upper Iowa women's soccer team (3-9-2, 1-8-1 GLVC) travels for the final time this season to face Missouri-St. Louis (8-3-2, 7-1-2 GLVC) and Maryville (Mo.) (8-1-4, 6-1-3 GLVC). The Peacocks play the Tritons on Friday, Oct. 24, at 12:30 p.m. and the Saints on Sunday, Oct. 25, at noon. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
